  "job_B9.2.7_20251003_115004": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6m onwalde wonn. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he ofslog Proculus & Bonorum; \u00fea gierndon eac \u00e6fter \u00fe\u00e6m onwalde. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m he wear\u00f0 self ofslagen on Sirmie \u00fe\u00e6re dune. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & XXXIX, feng Carus to Romana onwalde, & gefeaht tuwwa wi\u00f0 Parthe, & geeode hiora burga twa; \u00fea w\u00e6ron on Tigris sta\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6re ie. Ra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s hiene ofslog an \u00feunor. & his sunu Numerianus feng to \u00fe\u00e6m onwalde. & ra\u00fee \u00fe\u00e6s hiene ofslog his agen sweor. \u00c6fter \u00fe\u00e6m \u00fee Romeburg getimbred w\u00e6s M wintra & XLI, feng Dioclitianus to Romano He gesette under him gingran casere, Maximus w\u00e6s haten, & hiene sende on Gallie, for \u00feon \u00f0e On \u00fe\u00e6re tide w\u00e6ron Dioclitie III cyningas on winnende: Caucarius on Bretlande, & Achileus of \u00dea gesette he III caseras under him: an w\u00e6s Maximianus, o\u00feer Constantius, \u00feridda Galerius. Maximianus he sende on Affricam, & he oferwonn hiora wi\u00feerwinnan. & Constantius he sende on Gallie, & he oferwonn Alamanni \u00fe\u00e6t folc, & si\u00fe\u00fean he geeode & he self Dioclitianus for on \u00e6gypte, & bes\u00e6t Achileus \u00feone cyning eahta mona\u00f0 on Alexandria & Galerius he sende on Perse, & gefeaht II wi\u00f0 Marseus \u00feone cyning, \u00fe\u00e6t hiera na\u00feer n\u00e6fde \u00c6t heora \u00feriddan gefeohte Galerius wear\u00fe gefliemed, & mid micelre fyrhtnesse com to Ac he his on",
